  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ESDA Workshop Nairobi March 2012 UNU-ISP</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ESDA Workshop Nairobi mars 2012 UNU-ISP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xF6;d till workshop f&#xF6;r universitetspersonal inf&#xF6;r start av Masterprogram. UNU Institute for Sustainability and Peace (UNU-ISP) planerar att tillsammans med en grupp afrikanska universitet starta ett Masterprogram i h&#xE5;llbar utveckling i Afrika. Syftet med  programmet (ESDA) &#xE4;r att m&#xF6;ta de stora utbildningsbehoven inom h&#xE5;llbar utveckling.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to workshop for university staff prior to the start of Mastersprogram in sustainable development in Africa. UNU Institute for Sustainability and Peace (UNU-ISP) is planning to work with a group of African Universities to develop a Masters program in sustainable development. The purpose of the program (ESDA) is to meet the needs for education in sustainable development in Africa.</narrative>
  </description>
